        <mxCell id="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-34" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Общие практики по Data Privacy, применяемые по всем взаимодействиям:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2478&quot; data-start=&quot;2460&quot;&gt;TLS 1.2+ везде&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; (внешние и внутренние API);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2563&quot; data-start=&quot;2508&quot;&gt;Тегирование данных (&lt;code data-end=&quot;2535&quot; data-start=&quot;2530&quot;&gt;PII&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-end=&quot;2542&quot; data-start=&quot;2537&quot;&gt;MED&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code data-end=&quot;2560&quot; data-start=&quot;2555&quot;&gt;FIN, INT&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; для маршрутизации и доступа;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot; data-start=&quot;2594&quot;&gt;RBAC + ABAC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; — гибкая модель доступа на уровне ролей, ресурсов, атрибутов (время, IP, принадлежность);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2724&quot; data-start=&quot;2701&quot;&gt;Логирование и аудит&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; — для всех действий с &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2752&quot; data-start=&quot;2747&quot;&gt;PII&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; и &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2760&quot; data-start=&quot;2755&quot;&gt;MED;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2760&quot; data-start=&quot;2755&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2796&quot; data-start=&quot;2763&quot;&gt;Контроль согласий (&lt;code data-end=&quot;2793&quot; data-start=&quot;2784&quot;&gt;Consent&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; — не допускается работа с данными пациента без подтверждения;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2911&quot; data-start=&quot;2860&quot;&gt;Маскирование/редактирование данных по контексту&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; — ограничение лишней информациию&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-400" y="400" width="690" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-38" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-5" target="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-6">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-39" value="tag access \ read only" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-38">
          <mxGeometry x="-0.0038" y="1" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-41" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;MVP-решение включает&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Клиентский портал;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Бэкенд АПИ (для упрощения можно сделать единую точку обработки всех запросов,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;но в целях безопасности, отказоустойчивости и возможностей масштабирования&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;лучше сразу реализовать через микросервисы);&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Интерфейс для работников ресепшена;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. DLP-систему&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Файловый сервер&lt;/b&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;1743&quot; data-start=&quot;1705&quot;&gt;продолжает использоваться временно&lt;/span&gt; как источник исторических данных и временное хранилище для сканов.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;В перспективе&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;будет &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2286&quot; data-start=&quot;2265&quot;&gt;полностью заменён&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; на объектное хранилище с шифрованием и доступом по токену.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;1С&lt;/b&gt; участвует как внешняя система учёта, &lt;span data-end=&quot;2478&quot; data-start=&quot;2449&quot;&gt;интегрированная через API. Б&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;3013&quot; data-start=&quot;2949&quot;&gt;ольше не является основным хранилищем чувствительных&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;3013&quot; data-start=&quot;2949&quot;&gt;данных&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, она получает только то, что нужно ей по назначению (учёт, финансы, отчётность).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Оранжевым&lt;/b&gt; выделены контейнеры, не входящие в MVP, но являющиеся обязательными для достижения бизнес-целей в целевом решении&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-396" y="125" width="810" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-43" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.75;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-1" target="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-4">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-44" value="&lt;h2 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;89&quot; data-start=&quot;59&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;89&quot; data-start=&quot;66&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Как хранятся данные&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot; data-start=&quot;91&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;1. &lt;strong data-end=&quot;132&quot; data-start=&quot;101&quot;&gt;В БД:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot; data-start=&quot;91&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; data-end=&quot;150&quot; data-start=&quot;145&quot;&gt;Тэги: PII&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; data-end=&quot;157&quot; data-start=&quot;152&quot;&gt;MED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot; data-start=&quot;182&quot;&gt;FIN, INT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot; data-start=&quot;91&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Шифрование: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; data-end=&quot;217&quot; data-start=&quot;212&quot;&gt;TDE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot; data-start=&quot;91&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Контроль доступа: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; data-end=&quot;281&quot; data-start=&quot;275&quot;&gt;RBAC&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot; data-start=&quot;282&quot;&gt;ABAC&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, фильтрация по тегам (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; data-end=&quot;316&quot; data-start=&quot;311&quot;&gt;PII&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; data-end=&quot;323&quot; data-start=&quot;318&quot;&gt;MED&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot; data-start=&quot;91&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Встроенная система аудита&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;428&quot; data-start=&quot;382&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;2. &lt;strong data-end=&quot;428&quot; data-start=&quot;392&quot;&gt;В файловом сервере (1С и сканы):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;428&quot; data-start=&quot;382&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Хранятся: сканы договоров, платёжные документы, отчёты 1С&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;428&quot; data-start=&quot;382&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Шифрование: BitLocker (или EFS), шифрование папок&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;428&quot; data-start=&quot;382&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Доступ: ограничен через группы AD, дополнительные ACL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;428&quot; data-start=&quot;382&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;В перспективе — миграция в объектное хранилище с токенизированным доступом&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;701&quot; data-start=&quot;675&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;3. &lt;strong data-end=&quot;701&quot; data-start=&quot;685&quot;&gt;В Data Lake:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;701&quot; data-start=&quot;675&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Хранятся: только &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; data-end=&quot;739&quot; data-start=&quot;729&quot;&gt;INTERNAL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, агрегированные данные&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;701&quot; data-start=&quot;675&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Хранилище: объектное (ClickHouse)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;701&quot; data-start=&quot;675&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Доступ: read-only, через ML/BI Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot; data-start=&quot;930&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;4. &lt;strong data-end=&quot;958&quot; data-start=&quot;940&quot;&gt;В ML/BI среде:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot; data-start=&quot;930&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Данные не хранятся постоянно&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot; data-start=&quot;930&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Получаются по запросу из &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; data-end=&quot;1028&quot; data-start=&quot;1017&quot;&gt;Data Lake&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, затем удаляются после сессии&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot; data-start=&quot;930&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Среда изолирована (без интернет-доступа, без USB)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-400" y="645" width="490" height="620" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-45" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Периоды и условия уничтожения конфиденциальных данных:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PII: &lt;/b&gt;Срок хранения - 5 лет после окончания обслуживания, Удаление - по запросу или по истечению срока;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;MED: &lt;/b&gt;Срок хранения - 10 лет,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Удаление - п&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;о истечению срока или решению врача/пациента;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Consent:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Срок хранения - 5 лет,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Удаление - п&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;о истечению срока или отзыву пациента;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FIN:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Срок хранения - 5 лет,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Удаление - п&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;о истечению срока;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;BI-отчеты:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Срок хранения - 30 дней,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Удаление - п&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;о завершению анализа;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-413" y="1305" width="620" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0yRExd7zO0PyIydidvAR-46" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="uZ0quFO-MIEIE11IO5jD-23" target="E8wzmLQYG9MGAdb4BRr0-5">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
